<title>USA: NYSE closing averages.</title>
<headline>NYSE closing averages.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prices on the New York Stock Exchange closed lower in moderate trading Tuesday.</p>
<p>The Dow Jones Industrial Average fell 58.92 to 6896.56.</p>
<p>The NYSE Composite fell 2.97 to 415.40.</p>
<p>The average price per share fell $0.31.</p>
<p>Losers beat gainers 1643 to 844.</p>
<p>Volume was 467,304,080 compared with 494,430,120 on Monday.</p>
